/* Pure service islands. Consumer defines:
 * HOTSWAP_SERVICE(id, source_tu, private_headers, contract_headers, stable_imports,
 *                 abi_fingerprint, schema_fingerprint, wire_fingerprint,
 *                 kat_fingerprint, probe_leaf)
 *
 * Static callers retain parsing, authentication, persistence and effects.
 * Listed sources may calculate only over caller-owned values/buffers. */

